    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "n1003",
      "name": "标注-商机管理",
      "x": 5800.0,
      "y": 0.0,
      "width": 400.0,
      "height": "fit_content",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 12.0,
      "padding": 24.0,
      "cornerRadius": 12.0,
      "fill": [
        {
          "type": "solid",
          "color": "#FEF3C7"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "n1004",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "height": "fit_content",
          "content": "商机管理 · 规则说明",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13.0,
          "fontWeight": 700,
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "fill": [
            {
              "type": "solid",
              "color": "#78350F"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "n1005",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "height": "fit_content",
          "content": "1. 一个客户最多一条商机；登记时同时创建客户档案。老客户的新需求走「新建客户询盘」。",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13.0,
          "fontWeight": 400,
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "fill": [
            {
              "type": "solid",
              "color": "#78350F"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "n1006",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "height": "fit_content",
          "content": "2. 必填：联系人名称、国家、来源渠道、首次接触日期（默认今天，不晚于今天）。客户名称可暂缺，列表显示联系人名称并标「未填客户名称」。",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13.0,
          "fontWeight": 400,
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "fill": [
            {
              "type": "solid",
              "color": "#78350F"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "n1007",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "height": "fit_content",
          "content": "3. 查重：客户名称+国家、邮箱（忽略大小写）、WhatsApp / 电话（只比数字，+49 与 0049 视为相同，少于 6 位不比）任一相同即拦截，提示已有客户与负责人，并给出「为该客户新建询盘」。",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13.0,
          "fontWeight": 400,
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "fill": [
            {
              "type": "solid",
              "color": "#78350F"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "n1008",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "height": "fit_content",
          "content": "4. 阶段全部手动：进行中阶段可前进 / 回退；S1、S2 可标无效，S3 起标输单，S7 才能赢单；无效 / 输单需选原因；结束后可重新打开回到原阶段。每次变更记入阶段记录。",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13.0,
          "fontWeight": 400,
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "fill": [
            {
              "type": "solid",
              "color": "#78350F"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "n1009",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "height": "fit_content",
          "content": "5. 统计按首次接触日期；有效 = 曾进入 S3；有效率 = 有效 ÷ 新增，一位小数，新增为 0 显示「—」。数据范围随账号数据权限（仅本人 / 部门 / 全部）。",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13.0,
          "fontWeight": 400,
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "fill": [
            {
              "type": "solid",
              "color": "#78350F"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "n1010",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "height": "fit_content",
          "content": "6. 附件：图片（JPG、PNG）与 Excel，单个 ≤ 10MB，最多 10 个；非公开存储，需有商机菜单权限才能预览下载。",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13.0,
          "fontWeight": 400,
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "fill": [
            {
              "type": "solid",
              "color": "#78350F"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "n1011",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "height": "fit_content",
          "content": "7. 创建客户询盘：带入客户、需求摘要，可勾选带入附件；询盘记录来源商机，商机阶段不自动变化。",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13.0,
          "fontWeight": 400,
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "fill": [
            {
              "type": "solid",
              "color": "#78350F"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "n1012",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "height": "fit_content",
          "content": "8. 交互：登记用右侧抽屉，回车保存、Esc 关闭；「保存并继续登记」便于连续录入；保存成功用 Toast 提示。过渡 200ms ease-out。",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13.0,
          "fontWeight": 400,
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "fill": [
            {
              "type": "solid",
              "color": "#78350F"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "editorMeta": {
    "activePageIndex": 0,
    "preserveAuthoredGeometry": false
  }
}